# Route: guide 33 of 50 of the simulator's completionist route for Skyborne
# (1539 of 1546 eligible quests, 166.6 h, world baeac23fbe5e): levels 52 to
# 54, 28 quests, 4.0 h under the model. The order is the simulator's (`sim run
# --objective completionist`, then `sim export`; docs/SIMULATION.md §10): fix
# a step in the exporter or the data, not only here, so the next export keeps
# it.
#
# Flow (Burning Steppes, Blasted Lands, Swamp of Sorrows): Morgan's Vigil ->
# Dreadmaul Rock -> Morgan's Vigil -> Ruins of Thaurissan -> Blackrock
# Stronghold -> Ruins of Thaurissan -> The Pillar of Ash -> Blackrock Mountain
# -> Morgan's Vigil -> Dreadmaul Rock -> Morgan's Vigil -> Nethergarde Keep ->
# Splinterspear Junction -> ….
#
# Optional (elite: grouping up is advised): Dragonkin Menace (4182; Black
# Dragonspawn 52-53, Black Drake 50-52, Black Wyrmkin 53-54).
#
# Left to other guides: class quests (the Class category); dungeon quests (the
# Dungeons guides): Dark Iron Legacy (3802), A Taste of Flame (4024), The
# Heart of the Mountain (4123), Marshal Windsor (4241), Incendius! (4263), Put
# Her Down (4701), Egg Freezing (4734), Egg Collection (4735), Doomrigger's
# Clasp (4764), Maxwell's Mission (5081), General Drakkisath's Demise (5102),
# Nekrum's Medallion (2991).

